@startuml
title Change 2 - Real-Time Shipment Tracking

class Shipment {
    shipment_id
    order_id
    vehicle_id
    driver_id
    route_id
    status
}

class ShipmentTracking {
    tracking_id
    shipment_id
    latitude
    longitude
    location
    status
    recorded_at
}

class TransportationRepository {
    +create_tracking_update(tracking)
    +get_tracking_history(shipment_id, limit)
}

class TrackingAPI {
    POST /delivery-tracking
    GET /shipments/{shipment_id}/tracking
}

Shipment "1" --> "0..*" ShipmentTracking : has tracking records

TrackingAPI --> TransportationRepository : uses
TransportationRepository --> ShipmentTracking : persists / retrieves

note right of ShipmentTracking
    Separate tracking representation
    allows multiple location updates
    for the same shipment.
end note

@enduml
